# Status: TESTED AND WORKING with caveats (verified 2026-07-29 on a GB10, 128GB unified memory)
# 117B total / ~5.1B active MoE, native MXFP4, ~61GB weights, ~34GB KV cache headroom.
#
# KNOWN ISSUES:
# - Tool calls only surface correctly via /v1/responses, NOT /v1/chat/completions.
#   If your client only speaks chat-completions tool_calls, tool use will silently
#   do nothing (the model reasons about calling a tool but the field never appears).
# - Under concurrent requests, the harmony output parser has occasionally returned
#   garbled/raw output instead of a clean response (logged as "Harmony parser ended
#   in a non-terminal state"). Rare, but a known rough edge of this specific
#   nightly-era vLLM + gpt-oss combination.
# - Requires the tiktoken vocab files (TIKTOKEN_ENCODINGS_BASE in config.env;
#   install.sh downloads them) -- without them, every chat request fails with a
#   HarmonyError about a missing vocab file, even though the server boots fine.
MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
MAX_MODEL_LEN=131072
GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.85
EXTRA_ARGS=
